    (t.G 4) hlen hb hC1 hG1 (by omega) hA1 (by simp +decide [t4, t3, t2, t1, h0])
    (by simp +decide [t4, t3, t2, t1]) (by simp +decide [t4, t3, t2, t1, hF2])
