/-!
# KFUU §2g: phase 2 in IL (one iteration)

`p2B` divides `M` by `U²`, calls the swap entry with the descriptor
`[w, u, 1, 3, 5, U^k, U, U^{n-2-2k}, U, U^k·Bh]`, and multiplies `A = U^k` and `C = U^k·Bh` by `U`.
